.\" Manpage for git release
.\" https://github.com/xploSEoF/git-moar
.TH "GIT\-RELEASE" "1" "2025-12-18" "1.0" "GitMOAR Manual"
.SH "NAME"
git-release \- A method for easing the creation of semver tags
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.nf
\fIgit release [-y] [-p|--push] [<version>]\fR
.fi
.sp
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
Make a git (and npm) release
.SH "OPTIONS"
.PP
-y
.RS 4
Assume yes to any and all questions\&.
Currently, there is only one question confirming the new version before making any changes\&.
.RE
.PP
-p, --push
.RS 4
Push the tag and any changes to github, and if it's a fully named npm repository, npm publish, too\&.
.RE
.PP
<version>
.RS 4
A versions string, optionally begining with a "v", or any of the keywords "major", "minor", or "patch" where it increments a semver release accordingly\&.
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.sp
\fBgit-tag\fR(1)
